Subject: [PATCH] msi: _Validation modes, ADVERTISE action, _Streams/_Storages
 modes, internal UI and more (3215)

MsiViewModify REPLACE/VALIDATE/VALIDATE_NEW/VALIDATE_FIELD/VALIDATE_DELETE
against the _Validation table (new validate.c) with the MsiViewGetError error
list; _Streams and _Storages DELETE, REPLACE, MERGE, REFRESH and
INSERT_TEMPORARY; ValidateProductID templates; ACTION=ADVERTISE
(AdvtExecuteSequence), MsiAdvertiseProduct[Ex] and MsiAdvertiseScript;
MsiProvideAssembly and MsiProvideComponentFromDescriptor; MsiApplyPatch for
network images and single instances; MsiConfigureProductEx SOURCE/ADVERTISED;
internal UI messages (FilesInUse, Cancel button, ResolveSource), ListView
selection and SpawnWaitDialog; MsiGetMode(ZAWENABLED).

CORE review: behaviour change, see patches/notes/3215.txt.

